NOT discharged by execution; they were split to a tracked issue by explicit human decision
at merge. Recorded verbatim, unsoftened:

- **F1/F2 (DARK / TEST-ONLY / LAUNDERED-TO-FOLLOWUP).** #1427's headline "one arena
  consumed by logic:/lang:/math: lowering" is TEST-ONLY: every caller of the `lower.rs`
  lowering functions is `#[cfg(test)]`; the shipped demonstrators bypass lowering via direct
  `dag.intern_leaf`/`dag.intern_app` (`crates/logic/src/goal_directed.rs:279-285`), and
