Issue #1383 — genuine correspondence recovery (Mnemomorphism gate) — stage 2
Recorded 2026-07-16. Exit completion-adversary returned PASS (every acceptance
criterion DEMONSTRATED-IN-PRODUCTION, incl. a live production mutation flip on the
WritingSystem case). The disclosures below are honest carve-outs / accepted scope
decisions, NOT open gaps.

- IS0 REVERSE LEG resolved by HONEST DOC, not by executing it (human-signed-off:
  "Honest doc + drop inert fold"). The plan's original ask was to "execute both
  directions" (get∘put=id_view) for logic:Isomorphism. Investigation proved the
  reverse leg, seeded (as a recovery case must be) from the source, is
  MATHEMATICALLY ENTAILED by the section direction put∘get=id_source and cannot
  fail independently; and lower_recovery_case binds every view variable to the
  source, so the declared view is exactly im(get) — a section-passing iso is
  bijective on its declared corpus. A genuinely EXECUTED independent-view iso
  surjectivity check would require extending the recovery-case fragment with
  view-only witnesses; this was EXPLICITLY NOT UNDERTAKEN (out of #1383's
  Section/Retraction scope). LOGIC-CONFORMANCE.md was corrected to state the
  reverse leg is "entailed rather than executed as a separate leg"; the inert
  two-direction fold was dropped so no hollow "both directions" code ships.

- ATOMIC pure-path mnemomorphic auto-discharge ACCEPTED AS DOCUMENTED
  (human-signed-off: "Accept as documented"). A mnemomorphic pure-atomic-leg claim
  with NO authored recovery case discharges from a synthesized one-triple seed —
  genuine execution scoped to the documented DischargeBoundedCorpus, but nothing
  forces a richer distinguishing case. Seed freshness was hardened (G2 reserved
  namespace) so the synthesized seed cannot collide with authored constants.

- get_leg / recoveryCase reconciliation (candidate gap G3) CLOSED AS FALSE POSITIVE
  with evidence, NOT fixed: when a recovery case is present, get_leg's LegPath body
  is inert (no gate reads it; derive_put's provisional claim is re-checked against
  the recovery verdict; get_leg resolves to a TransactionProgram node never rendered
  as shipped SPARQL). Authored data uses get_leg as a decorative placeholder
  (sup:XStep) solely to satisfy derive_put's non-None precondition. The
  required-but-decorative get_leg convention remains in place — pre-existing, not a
  soundness gap, out of scope.

- FULL LOCAL `make check` NOT COMPLETED in stage 2 (user directed reliance on CI,
  which builds this PR merged-into-main on push, after stopping the local run).
  Stage-2 verification rests on: exit completion-adversary PASS (live production
  demonstrations + a red->pass mutation flip), conformance correspondence suite
  12/12, gmeow-logic + gmeow-logic-compile 1742/1742, gmeow-pipeline correspondence
  subset 30/30, docs goldens 85/85, and a full merged-tree compile — all green. The
  authoritative full `make check` merged-into-main is delegated to CI / stage 3.

- COVERAGE-RATCHET baseline bumped +3 for the recovery-case vocabulary
  (logic:RecoveryCase / recoveryCase / recoveryTransform) across missing-annotation-
  coat / competency-rationale / example / fixture-pair / prose-quality / scope-note /
